<title>USA: Incomnet sells stake in unit, Rapid Cast.</title>
<headline>Incomnet sells stake in unit, Rapid Cast.</headline>
<dateline>WOODLAND HILLS, Calif. 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Incomnet Inc on Friday said J.P. Morgan Capital Corp, the equity investment wing of brokerage J.P. Morgan and affiliates of Clipper Group Have acquired a minority interest in Incomnet's unit, Rapid Cast Inc, for $12 million.</p>
<p>The Investors also have an option to invest an additional $10 million over the next 18 months. Funds will be used primarily to finance growth.</p>
<p>Rapid Cast makes and sells a technology that allows retailers, opticians and optical laboratories to produce ophthalmic eyeglass lenses on demand.</p>
</text>
